# Agentic Workstation Optimizer (`agentic-workstation-optimizer`)

When asked to diagnose or optimize workstation performance, network speed, Cloud AI API connectivity, automated testing port limits, WSL2 networking, or local AI (Ollama/GPU):

1. Follow the steps in [SKILL.md](mdc:SKILL.md).
2. Run the read-only diagnostic script first:
   `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ./scripts/diagnose-network-ai.ps1 -SaveReport`
3. On company workstations, do not change corporate DNS, VPN, or router settings. Run `./scripts/optimize-workstation.ps1` to automatically back up current settings and apply local Windows, NIC, Node.js/Git, WSL2, and GPU/Ollama optimizations.
